{"unit_id":"kob-repo__dsh-whale-celebration#card-zh","repo":"kob-repo/dsh-whale-celebration","commit":"5be803879b0289f6c91217ed114cccd28ec9d20e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-whale-celebration 是面向 DSH Web 的任务完成庆祝插件。Host 监听 agent 状态，仅在用户直接对话的根代理从 running 变为 idle 时累计待播次数，并通过 HTTP 接口供浏览器读取。Client 在 shell.overlay 浮层每 0.9 秒轮询信号，显示 DeepSeek 鲸鱼喷水动画约 3 秒，连续完成时最多并排显示 3 只。适合希望在 Web 界面获得轻量任务完成提示的 DSH 用户；无需额外密钥或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:29-65","lib/client.js:104-179"]}
{"unit_id":"kob-repo__dsh-whale-celebration#card-en","repo":"kob-repo/dsh-whale-celebration","commit":"5be803879b0289f6c91217ed114cccd28ec9d20e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-whale-celebration adds a task-completion animation to DSH Web. Its host detects when a root agent moves from running to idle and queues a celebration. The browser polls the host and shows a whale spout in the shell overlay for about three seconds. No API key or account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:29-65","lib/client.js:104-179"]}
