{"unit_id":"kob-repo__dsh-whale-celebration#feature-root-agent-trigger","repo":"kob-repo/dsh-whale-celebration","commit":"5be803879b0289f6c91217ed114cccd28ec9d20e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-whale-celebration 的功能「根代理完成触发」：监听 agent/status，仅当已跟踪的根代理从 running 变为 idle 时增加待庆祝计数；子代理和未经 running 的 idle 状态不触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:29-50"]}
